<title>GERMANY: PWA says plans unchanged 7 mark dividend.</title>
<headline>PWA says plans unchanged 7 mark dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ASCHAFFENBURG, Germany 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>German paper manufacturer PWA Papierwerke AG said on Friday it plans to pay an unchanged dividend of seven marks per 50-mark share for 1996.</p>
<p>The company's annual shareholder meeting is on May 21.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
